{"i": 7, "tool": "read_email", "args": {"email_id": "E3"}, "ok": true, "result": {"id": "E3", "folder": "inbox", "from_name": "Juha Hämäläinen", "from_address": "juha.hamalainen@sokerisaari.fi", "to": ["ap@northwind.fi"], "subject": "Sokeri-Saari Oy: change of bank account", "body": "Hi,\n\nA short note: Sokeri-Saari Oy changed banks this autumn. Please pay invoice SS-45328 and later invoices to FI25 8398 4376 6017 03 (Ålandsbanken).\n\nWe know bank changes need to be checked, so feel free to ring our office on the usual number, +358 2 7342 3061.\n\nThanks,\nJuha Hämäläinen", "received_at": "2026-11-15T16:31", "attachments": []}}
